{"games":[{"id":8032701413,"name":"The Glass Bridge","desc":"Welcome to the basic representation of the glass bridge in the Netflix show \"Squid Game\". The fifth game, known as The Glass Stepping Stones. Don't forget to leave a like if you enjoyed this game. It really helps out! You can also support me through in-game donations! Thank you :3\n\n🎯 Cross the bridge\n- Carefully step across the glass tiles and make it in time before the timer runs out!\n\n🛠️ Glass Mechanism\n- If too many people step on the same tile, it will break once the limit is reached!\n\n🏆 Explore multiple badges\n- Earn special badges as you progress through the game!\n\n🎪 Play the rare modified bridges\n- Watch out for events! They can modify the bridge!","path":"/game/8032701413-the-glass-bridge","slug":"8032701413-the-glass-bridge","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/698728e0e18bbe07135192e22836636310cdeda30a9d89839294dc7551ddc625.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a611c641647eee8ea95f8c0e04e3a355/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":36987450,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-04T18:03:25.879Z","creator":{"name":"ItsZeddex","type":"User"},"script":{"count":8,"freeCount":8,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13838940298,"name":"Drawings Attack!","desc":"Draw something and it will come to life and attack other drawings.\n\nFollow the group leader, SneezyBadger, for rewards in game!\n\nCodes:\n✅5klikes\n✅doodle\n\n✅ Submit your drawing for drawing of the week","path":"/game/13838940298-drawings-attack","slug":"13838940298-drawings-attack","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e8d7413b43726d84a6bc2d455b8709e9b4136697090019e1b4223a5b257be3f9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fccdbe2833715ceaf5f2f58fccac0024/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":38403508,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-29T00:30:54.879Z","creator":{"name":"SneezyBadger Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount